[[2047,96,65536,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The boot opening switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends\nan earth signal, with the boot open, to integrated services control\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40.</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              (pin 14 of connector C) and simultaneously to boot\nlight \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and to tailgate light \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G41</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              is supplied by an\nignition-operated supply (INT) - pin 7 of connector B from the line\nprotected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of supplementary fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and\ndirectly by the battery.  (maxifuse J/B2 of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) via fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F8</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nthe junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 8 of connector B).</p><p>When the signal that the boot is open arrives,\nthe control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends the timed supply signal, from\npin 2 of connector C, which operates the lights \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G41</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The supply for the glove compartment light \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               ignition-operated\n(INT/A) from the line protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F6</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of additional\nfuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , and is activated by an earth signal from the\nglove compartment switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Sun visor lights \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G31</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G32</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               are\ncontrolled by the ignition (INT) by the line for fuse\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              of\nthe junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and are activated by the switch inside\nthe actual lights.</p>"]]